{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33078","headline":"和茅山高拾遗忆山中杂题五首 巢鹤 · 储嗣宗","name":"和茅山高拾遗忆山中杂题五首 巢鹤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千万云间丁令威，殷勤仙骨莫先飞。\n若逢茅氏传消息，贞白先生不久归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储嗣宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33078.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33078","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}